<%@ page isErrorPage="true" contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" %><%! String e(Object v){return v==null?"Not available":v.toString().replace("&","&amp;").replace("<","&lt;").replace(">","&gt;").replace("\"","&quot;");} %><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>SSO Test Error</title><style><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/style.css" %>.plain-shell{max-width:880px;margin:36px auto;padding:0 22px 48px}.plain-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:0 0 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ef}.plain-header h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;color:#1f3f68}.plain-header .eyebrow{color:#54708f}.plain-home{color:#28537e;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.error-state{margin-top:24px;padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #c24b42;background:#fff4f2}.error-state h2{margin:0 0 5px;color:#a43b32;font-size:23px}.error-state p{margin:0;color:#5d403c}.plain-section{margin-top:20px;padding:20px;border:1px solid #dbe3ef;border-radius:6px;background:#fff}.plain-section h2{margin:0 0 14px;color:#244a73;font-size:19px}.plain-checklist{margin-top:20px;padding:20px;border-left:4px solid #d09a2c;background:#fff9e8}.plain-checklist h2{margin:0 0 10px;color:#76540b;font-size:19px}.plain-checklist li{margin:8px 0}.plain-warning{margin-top:18px;color:#735b1d;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:720px){.plain-shell{margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px 34px}.plain-header h1{font-size:23px}table{min-width:620px}}</style></head><body><main class="plain-shell"><header class="plain-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">WebLogic SAML sample</p><h1>SAML SSO Test Application</h1></div><a class="plain-home" href="./">Return home</a></header><section class="error-state"><h2>SSO or authorization error</h2><p>The application received limited error information. A SAML failure can occur before this application is invoked.</p></section><section class="plain-section"><h2>Available request information</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><tr><th>Observed at</th><td><%=e(java.time.Instant.now())%></td></tr><tr><th>Message</th><td><pre><%=e(exception == null ? request.getAttribute("javax.servlet.error.message") : exception.toString())%></pre></td></tr><tr><th>Request URI</th><td><%=e(request.getAttribute("javax.servlet.error.request_uri"))%></td></tr><tr><th>Status</th><td><%=e(request.getAttribute("javax.servlet.error.status_code"))%></td></tr><tr><th>Authenticated principal, if available</th><td><%=e(request.getRemoteUser() == null ? request.getUserPrincipal() : request.getRemoteUser())%></td></tr><tr><th>Client address</th><td><%=e(request.getRemoteAddr())%></td></tr><tr><th>Request correlation ID</th><td><%=e(request.getHeader("X-Request-ID"))%></td></tr></table></div></section><section class="plain-checklist"><h2>What to check in WebLogic</h2><ol><li>Record the timestamp, request URI, status, and correlation ID shown above.</li><li>Temporarily enable the following WebLogic debugs - <code>ATN</code>, <code>ATZ</code>, <code>HTTPdebug</code>, and <code>SAML2</code>.</li><li>Reproduce the issue once, then compare the WebLogic server log with the IdP sign-in/audit log.</li><li>Disable debugging after collecting the required evidence.</li></ol></section><p class="plain-warning">Make sure that the logging severity is set to Debug.</p></main></body></html>
